1.21.1: macOS build fix

parallel.c asked for strict POSIX (_POSIX_C_SOURCE 200809L), which on
macOS hides _SC_NPROCESSORS_ONLN, so the thread count failed to compile
there from 1.18.0 on. The file now also defines _DARWIN_C_SOURCE, as
serve.c already did, and the Makefile adds -D_DARWIN_C_SOURCE on Darwin
so no future file trips on the same thing. No change to rendering.

